{"id":"eeba9709a4d47b84","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-frame-def.md","title":"GL Frame Definition","display":"df-gl-frame-def — GL Frame Definition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-frame-def","aliases":["89-df-gl-frame-def"],"display":"df-gl-frame-def — GL Frame Definition","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-frame]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-frame-def"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-frame-def</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-frame-def — GL Frame Definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> is a set of Kripke frames.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLFrame}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLFrame}\\)</span> is the predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}frame\\text{-}def}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak{F}_{G\\!L}(\\mathcal U)\\coloneqq\n\\{F\\in\\mathcal U\\mid\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}frame\\text{-}def}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak{F}_{G\\!L}(\\mathcal U)\\coloneqq\n\\{F\\in\\mathcal U\\mid\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>GL框架是传递且逆良基的</li>\n<li>逆良基：没有无限上升链</li>\n<li>GL框架对应可证明性语义</li>\n<li>参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> 保证这是集合分离；“所有集合大小的框架”若不限制\n宇宙只能在元语言中视为类。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLFrame}$ is the predicate from [[89-df-gl-frame]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLFrame}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}frame\\text{-}def}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak{F}_{G\\!L}(\\mathcal U)\\coloneqq\n\\{F\\in\\mathcal U\\mid\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false}],"bytes":803,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-247","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-frame-def]]"}],"outgoing":["c6ab46cd662b1409"]}